+## Typed seal and real effect ownership
+
+The terminal waiter currently starts the original wait Task at486, status callback at548 and key Task at553; its finally600–614 requests cancellation and awaits both actual tasks. Key reads at559 can still be synchronously blocked. Timeout/unavailable handling may publish `ready/turn_error.json` at509/523 through the handler787–831. Finalize tries joint reconciliation first at1756, before the ordinary Cancelled branch1759–1783 deletes protocol/output state and rolls back. A seal check placed only in Cancelled would miss the earlier effectful joint route.
