+The proposed original-owned PresentationSealed result and private plain exception therefore address real hazards. They must bypass Stage broad rollback1672–1737, characteristic catch1629–1632, backup-capture cleanup1992–2019, baseline manifest cleanup569–583, CleanupBackup catch2443, game-loop logging1408–1440 and RunAsync logging/input/finally. Exceptions, CTS cancellation, EOF and observed Task status are not original held/settlement receipts. The proposal preserves true fault/uncertainty and secondary failures, stops the next semantic step before it runs, and requires actual input/render/callback joins. It explicitly leaves deep health/repair/normalizer catches and input adapters unclosed. This is a genuine engineering dependency; a new exception class alone would not make those paths safe.
